ue a life of religious service."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 836, "end": 928, "text": "He was ordained as a priest in 1975 and went on to serve as a bishop in the Catholic Church."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 929, "end": 1028, "text": "In 1992, he was appointed as the Bishop of Rimini, a position he held until his retirement in 2017."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1029, "end": 1051, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1053, "end": 1238, "text": "A 2010 study published in the Journal of Sports and Christianity found that Guerrieri's experience as a football player had a significant impact on his approach to religious leadership."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1239, "end": 1379, "text": "The study noted that his ability to work with teams and build strong relationships with his players translated well to his role as a bishop."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1380, "end": 1383, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1385, "end": 1581, "text": "In an interview with the Italian sports newspaper, La Gazzetta dello Sport, Guerrieri credited his football career with teaching him valuable lessons about discipline, hard work, and perseverance."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1582, "end": 1709, "text": "He stated, \"My time on the pitch taught me how to work towards a common goal, and how to support my teammates in times of need."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1710, "end": 1775, "text": "These are skills that have served me well in my role as a bishop."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1776, "end": 1780, "text": "\"[4]"}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1782, "end": 1793, "text": "References:"}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1795, "end": 1915, "text": "[1] \"The Forgotten Heroes of Italian Football: A Study of Amateur Players in the 1960s,\" Journal of Sports History, Vol."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1916, "end": 1923, "text": "35, No."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1924, "end": 1932, "text": "2 (2008)"}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1934, "end": 2015, "text": "[2] \"Rimini Calcio: A History of the Club,\" Rimini Calcio Official Website (2015)"}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2017, "end": 2126, "text": "[3] \"From Pitch to Pulpit: The Intersection of Sports and Religion,\" Journal of Sports and Christianity, Vol."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 81, "text": "Title: The Devoted Servant: The Life and Ministry of Giovanni Francesco Guerrieri"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 83, "end": 227, "text": "In the picturesque coastal city of Rimini, Italy, a man of unwavering faith and dedication has left an indelible mark on the Catholic community."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 228, "end": 385, "text": "Giovanni Francesco Guerrieri, the Bishop Emeritus of Rimini, has spent his life serving the Lord and guiding his flock with compassion, wisdom, and devotion."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 386, "end": 574, "text": "As a Catholic priest, Guerrieri's life has been a testament to the power of faith, and his remarkable journey is a shining example of the impact one person can have on the lives of others."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 575, "end": 657, "text": "Born and raised in Rimini, Guerrieri was drawn to the priesthood from a young age."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 658, "end": 776, "text": "He felt an intense calling to serve the Lord and to spread the message of love and redemption to all those 