tion grew, so did his responsibilities within the Church."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1951, "end": 2058, "text": "He was eventually appointed as the Bishop of Rimini, a position he held with great humility and dedication."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2059, "end": 2200, "text": "As bishop, Guerrieri continued to serve his community with unwavering commitment, guiding his flock through times of joy and times of sorrow."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2201, "end": 2371, "text": "He was a beacon of hope and a source of comfort to all those around him, and his leadership inspired a new generation of priests and laypeople to follow in his footsteps."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Italian bishop emeritus and former association football player", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Bishop Emeritus of Rimini", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C2", "answer": "Catholic priest", "card_ids": ["d2:c1"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Giovanni Francesco Guerrieri", "scope": "occupation", "claim": "Giovanni Francesco Guerrieri (born 1943) is an Italian bishop emeritus and former association football player.", "answer": "Italian bishop emeritus and former association football player", "quote": "Giovanni Francesco Guerrieri (born 1943) is an Italian bishop emeritus and former association football player.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Giovanni Francesco Guerrieri", "scope": "Occupation", "claim": "Giovanni Francesco Guerrieri is the Bishop Emeritus of Rimini.", "answer": "Bishop Emeritus of Rimini", "quote": "Giovanni Francesco Guerrieri, the Bishop Emeritus of Rimini, has spent his life serving the Lord and guiding his flock with compassion, wisdom, and devotion.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Giovanni Fr